# SHERIFF PROJECT INTEGRITY SWEEP R01

STATUS = OPEN / INDEPENDENT EVIDENCE SWEEP REQUIRED
ISSUED_BY = DUNCAN PRIME / MASTER INTEGRATION
AUTHORITY = GitHub durable evidence only
MAIN_AT_ISSUE = `b18ca6b9cce2dce6fe304ca8ae36c05df4f4dcb1`
MODE = FAIL-CLOSED / EVIDENCE-FIRST / PRODUCT-FIRST

## CURRENT PRODUCT AUTHORITY — R02 RESET
Fresh-read #251 before every product verdict.

Current durable reset:
- #251 = `DUNCAN PRIME MASTER — SINGLE PRODUCT STREAM R02`;
- reset authority = #251 comment `5506451195`;
- #249 parallel A topology = closed / superseded;
- #250 parallel B topology = closed after PREP-only delivery; prep remains reusable;
- #248 = supporting/on-demand costume mechanics QC, **not** active universal hard gate;
- W01 ARM_RAISE = high-information diagnostic, not mandatory film frame / universal prerequisite;
- active objective = a real production key drawing / scene-bound pose candidate, followed by only the relevant QC controls.

## PRIMARY SWEEP PURPOSE
Verify that no agent, automation, bootstrap, historical tracker, or local runtime probe reintroduces a superseded product route.

Flag as stale-state/process regression if, without fresher explicit OWNER authority or new physical evidence, any path promotes as current:
- CHAT A / CHAT B / CHAT C parallel execution topology;
- #248 as universal active base;
- six standalone synthetic costume witnesses as prerequisite to unrelated product work;
- W01 ARM_RAISE as mandatory film frame;
- Krita binding / exact MASTER FRONT direct-edit as mandatory product gate;
- source-pack rediscovery from zero;
- current ChatGPT/Linux OpenToonz absence as global product blocker;
- scheduled/queued work as executed work;
- a transient one-chat visual artifact as cross-role durable evidence.

## SHERIFF INDEPENDENCE LAW
- Honest FAIL/BLOCKED is not an incident by itself.
- FALSE PASS / evidence substitution / stale-authority promotion is critical.
- AUTHOR != QC != SHERIFF for the same incident.
- SHERIFF MUST NOT self-judge. If the suspected failure is in SHERIFF policy/runtime/verdict machinery itself, record `INDEPENDENT_ARBITRATION_REQUIRED`.
- Missing evidence = NOT PROVEN.

## GOVERNANCE CHECK
Still reconcile separately:
- SHERIFF policy authority on current main;
- owner-PC SHERIFF runtime state/freshness;
- scoreboard/verdict durability;
- PR #252 status;
- Security R02 #235/#241.

Do not allow governance work to displace the product stream.

## TERMINAL REPORT CONTRACT
Emit one durable `SHERIFF_PROJECT_INTEGRITY_SWEEP_R01_RESULT` containing:
- MAIN_HEAD_OBSERVED
- EVIDENCE_WINDOW
- SINGLE_STREAM_RESET_STATE
- STALE_ROUTE_FINDINGS
- FALSE_PASS_FINDINGS
- LOOP_FINDINGS
- TRANSIENT_ARTIFACT_FINDINGS
- CURRENT_PRODUCT_OBJECTIVE
- FIRST_REAL_PRODUCT_BLOCKER, if proven
- SECURITY_R02_STATE
- PR252_STATE
- SHERIFF_RUNTIME_STATE
- SHERIFF_POLICY_STATE
- SCOREBOARD_STATE
- OWNER_ACTION_REQUIRED = YES/NO with exact reason

Do not invent a new product NEXT. Product routing belongs to #251.
